 "remarks": "Exceptional opportunity to own a completely reimagined and expanded residence with a legal one-bedroom accessory dwelling unit (ADU). Privately set back from the road on a beautifully landscaped acre+, this extensively renovated property combines sophisticated finishes, modern infrastructure, and exceptional living space. The main residence features a stunning kitchen with quartz countertops, spacious island, white oak hardwood floors, a family room with wood-burning fireplace, and a deck overlooking the expansive backyard. An integrated audio system serves the first-floor dining, living and family rooms, plus the second-floor media room. Upstairs, generously sized bedrooms include en-suite accommodations, a media room, and conveniently accessible laundry. The ADU offers its own entrance, walkway, yard space, open-concept living and dining area, full kitchen with peninsula and pantry, spacious bedroom, full bathroom, and laundry. Major upgrades include new HVAC, 1,500-gallon septic tank, 200-amp underground electrical service, whole-house water filtration, EV charger, and generator-ready electrical infrastructure. An attached one-car garage, expansive driveway, natural stone walls, and mature landscaping complete this remarkable property.",
